{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"にょーん(ω)ひめたんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひめたんからみなさんに質問っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん新幹線で広島から東京まで４時間かかるんぢゃけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあいだ暇人なんよねー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから音楽聴いて過ごしとるんじゃけど、もっといろんな曲を聴きたーい(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの好きな曲を教えて下さいっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの音楽プレーヤーに追加したいなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意科目と苦手科目を教えて下さい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意科目は国語・社会(^^)ひめたんは文系人間なんだと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手科目は数学・保体・理科('`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"保体は実技ができないから...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが目標とするＡＫＢメンバーを教えて下さい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなのはこじはるさん(小嶋陽菜さん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"尊敬するのはゆきりんさん(柏木由紀さん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆきりんさんはＡＫＢとしてはもちろん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニットでも、個人でも活躍されてるところが憧れます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマ出てみたり、お天気お姉さんとかしてみたり(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもゆきりんさんみたいに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マルチに活躍できる人になることが目標です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※ごめんなさい('・・`)漢字を間違えてたので訂正させてもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ書くのに何時間かかってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかんだで２時間はかかっちゃうかな∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいから、記事完成するのあっという間ですよー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは好きなキャラクターって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいこなら誰でもうぇるかむ(^^)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本命はジャッキーちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/14/dimg0453_2.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャッキーちゃんは「くまのがっこう」って絵本のキャラクターで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12匹きょうだいの末っ子のおんなのこです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon